    "updated_at": "2016-02-29T12:01:51Z",
    "body": "This is the use counter data for Chrome:\n- [`<?xml-stylesheet type=\"...\" href=\"...\" ?>` in markup causing the document to be transformed using XSLT](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/78)\n- [`new XSLTProcessor` in script](https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/79)\n\nBoth are so low that there's a good chance for some simplification if this is spec'd from scratch.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
